       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. VULN-TEST.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 COMMAND-INPUT PIC X(100).
       01 BUFFER PIC X(50).
       01 OVERFLOW-BUFFER PIC X(10).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PROCEDURE.
      * VULNERABILITY COBOL001
           ACCEPT COMMAND-INPUT FROM COMMAND-LINE.
           
      * VULNERABILITY COBOL002
           STRING COMMAND-INPUT DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO OVERFLOW-BUFFER.
           
           STOP RUN.
